{
  "comment": "Cases that the Go detector (mapwizard.Detector) and the UI's copy of it must agree on (ADR-0072). Event kinds: b button (v 1 down, 0 up), a axis (v position), h hat (v direction mask). In 'want', '' means waiting; 'done:X' gives the binding value of the element the prompt found; 'rejected:R' gives the reason.",
